name two_way_loss_5pct
describe Two-way call (user <-> AI), audio and video both ways, 5% random loss each way on a 100 ms RTT link (#748)
duration 30s
call two-way
at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms loss=5%
reverse at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms loss=5%
# program.md 6.3 sev:2, for each direction: no freezes > 1 s or audio interruptions in moderate loss (<= 5%), and
# mouth-to-ear delay under 400 ms on a 100 ms RTT link.
expect up.audio.interruptions == 0
expect down.audio.interruptions == 0
expect up.video.longest_freeze_ms < 1000
expect down.video.longest_freeze_ms < 1000
expect up.audio.mouth_to_ear_p95_ms < 400
expect down.audio.mouth_to_ear_p95_ms < 400
